{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"gE","type":"group","x":-380,"y":1480,"width":3680,"height":620,"color":"6","label":"How does the harness improve its own rules?"},
		{"id":"gB","type":"group","x":1100,"y":-80,"width":2200,"height":820,"color":"6","label":"What runs in one stage?"},
		{"id":"gD","type":"group","x":1100,"y":740,"width":2200,"height":680,"color":"6","label":"Where does it run on Mastra?"},
		{"id":"gA","type":"group","x":-320,"y":-60,"width":1320,"height":700,"color":"6","label":"Which node makes what?"},
		{"id":"gC","type":"group","x":-400,"y":740,"width":1400,"height":640,"color":"6","label":"How is a rule enforced?"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"## binding\nSets what a fail does.\nvalues: `strict`, `soft`, `watch`","x":680,"y":800,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"never","type":"text","text":"## never\nCode gives no final grade or match.\nCannot verify is never pass or fail.","x":680,"y":1100,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"dom","type":"text","text":"## `domain` node\nCreates the criteria of the domain.\nreads: past criteria tables, records\nwrites: criteria, candidate attributes\nstage: `define_criteria`","x":-280,"y":-40,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"inn","type":"text","text":"## `inner` node\nJudges relevance and meaning of each criterion.\nreads: parent node criteria\nwrites: node criteria, additions, attributes\nstage: `create_node`","x":180,"y":-40,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"leaf","type":"text","text":"## `leaf` node\nGets the pack and the layout.\nreads: node criteria, attributes\nwrites: evaluation pack, layout\nstages: `create_pack`, `create_layout`","x":700,"y":60,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rec","type":"text","text":"## record system\nKeeps the research behind each output.\nwrites: research records, append-only\nlinks: each criterion, attribute, rule","x":220,"y":360,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"hdr","type":"text","text":"## Evaluation harness\nThe rule graph, its stages, rule enforcement, Mastra, self-improvement.\nparent: [docs hub](../README.md)\nscope: design only","x":0,"y":-360,"width":640,"height":200},
		{"id":"stamp","type":"text","text":"## stamp\ncode: the scaffold only, `main` at `4560d23`, 2026-10-25\nMastra `@mastra/core` 1.79.0, harness2 `1cfe254e`\ndescribes: design/*.md, plans/2026-10-24-harness-plan.md\n_unverified_","x":780,"y":-360,"width":640,"height":200},
		{"id":"asm","type":"text","text":"## `assimilate`\nAccepts the output into the graph.\nwrites: output, records, verdicts","x":1540,"y":400,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ctx","type":"text","text":"## `context`\nReads the graph for one node.\nreads: path to root, rules in scope\nreads: records, sibling nodes","x":1140,"y":-30,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rep","type":"text","text":"## `repair`\nSends the exact errors back.\nbudget: 3 rounds","x":2940,"y":490,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"jud","type":"text","text":"## `judge`\nRuns each rule in scope.\ndecides: pass, fail, cannot verify\nwrites: `VerdictRow`","x":2880,"y":-30,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dra","type":"text","text":"## `draft`\nFills the output that shape rules define.\nwrites: one output","x":2360,"y":-30,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"res","type":"text","text":"## `research`\nResearches under the rules.\ntools: `web_search`, `web_fetch`\ntools: `get_node_context`, `search_records`","x":1700,"y":-30,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"per","type":"text","text":"## `person`\nDecides on a spent budget.\nAlso decides on a strict cannot verify.","x":2120,"y":400,"width":240,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"msc","type":"text","text":"## scorers\nOne scorer for each check rule.\ncode checks: function steps\njudges: `analyze` prompt step","x":2790,"y":800,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"mag","type":"text","text":"## agents\nResearcher, drafter, editors.\nreads: `RequestContext` with the node\nwrites: `structuredOutput`","x":1960,"y":800,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"mdb","type":"text","text":"## our graph tables\nNodes, rules, records, verdicts.\nDrizzle ORM on the Mastra client","x":2140,"y":1100,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"mds","type":"text","text":"## datasets, experiments\nGolden examples and rule trials.\nCI gate: `runEvals`","x":1400,"y":1100,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"mwf","type":"text","text":"## workflows\nOne `createWorkflow` for each stage.\nrepair: `.dountil` with a budget\nperson: `suspend`, `resume`","x":1140,"y":800,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"mrules","type":"text","text":"## `rules/` in git\nStage rules, one YAML file each.\nreviewed by PR","x":2790,"y":1140,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f1","type":"file","file":"design/rule-graph.md","x":-300,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"f2","type":"file","file":"design/rule-enforcement.md","x":180,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"f3","type":"file","file":"design/self-improvement.md","x":640,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"f4","type":"file","file":"design/mastra-mapping.md","x":1140,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"f5","type":"file","file":"plans/2026-10-24-harness-plan.md","x":1640,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"rr","type":"text","text":"## `RuleRecord`\nOne instruction with its check.\nholds: id, version, statement, reason\nholds: kind, scope, binding, examples","x":-360,"y":800,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cmp","type":"text","text":"## rule compiler\nTurns rules in scope into checks.\nwrites: schema parts, instructions\nwrites: code checks, judge questions","x":180,"y":800,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"chg","type":"text","text":"## rule change\nTries a new version as watch.\nreads: golden examples, recent outputs\ndecides: Rohan promotes out of watch","x":280,"y":1100,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"iref","type":"text","text":"## reference runs\nk runs of the published rules.\nwrites: traces, outputs, visible verdicts","x":-340,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"iref2","type":"text","text":"## `reflector`\nWrites edit verdicts and at most one lesson.\nwrites: `lesson_library`","x":2950,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"isel","type":"text","text":"## `blind_selector`\nPicks one anonymous final output.","x":2380,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ico","type":"text","text":"## `composer`\nMerges, adopts one, or keeps the base.\nreads: probes against reference runs","x":1860,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"igate","type":"text","text":"## `promotion_gate`\nHeld-out suite on the rule owner subtree.\ndecides: Rohan says yes","x":2510,"y":1880,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ifw","type":"text","text":"## `measurement_firewall`\nKeeps the held-out suite away.\nrefuses: held-out paths and verdicts","x":900,"y":1860,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ival","type":"text","text":"## `proposal_validator`\nChecks the structure of each edit.\nretry: one, then the base","x":760,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ied","type":"text","text":"## editors\nPropose edits to the stage rules.\nkinds: process, domain\nreads: evidence pack, lessons","x":240,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ipr","type":"text","text":"## probes\nOne stage run for each candidate.\nwrites: traces, outputs","x":1260,"y":1540,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"gF","type":"group","x":-400,"y":2480,"width":3700,"height":700,"color":"6","label":"Where does each piece of data live?"},
		{"id":"dauth","type":"text","text":"## authoring database\nShared and persistent, not a local file.\nholds: authoring graph, Mastra run state\nwrites: the authoring stages","x":-340,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dart","type":"text","text":"## object storage\nLarge artifacts and published bundles.\nholds: research results, captures, transcripts\nholds: one hashed bundle per leaf","x":60,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dpub","type":"text","text":"## `publish`\nWrites one bundle per leaf.\nreads: the gated pack and layout\nwrites: a hashed bundle","x":460,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"deval","type":"text","text":"## eval author\nGrades products in its own environment.\nreads: one pinned bundle\nwrites: `product_evals`","x":860,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dchat","type":"text","text":"## chat\nReads the published knowledge.\nreads: a pinned bundle, or imported attributes","x":1260,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"dkdb","type":"text","text":"## Kyaloon database\nHolds the product evaluations.\nholds: `product_evals`","x":1660,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dopen","type":"text","text":"## open\nStores, bundle format, public reads.\nstatus: Rohan decides later","x":2060,"y":2560,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"f6","type":"file","x":-340,"y":2900,"width":400,"height":120,"file":"design/data-layers.md"}
	],
